{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c7d18e8a41dd2290dcb7acb642511154dc4deb04dcba0327b486cf6b948c2fd", "ja": "（今日は、PVのライブシーンの撮影だけど……\n未来、なんだかあまり調子がよくないみたいだな）", "zh": "（今天要拍PV里的演唱会场景……\n但未来的状况好像不太好。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "7bd60e4273ce9357f957a888f071eecff072372d5673db9824089a49fa678e1e", "ja": "お疲れさまです、休憩入りまーす！\n15分後に、撮影再開です！", "zh": "辛苦了，现在起是休息时间～！\n15分钟后继续拍摄！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "f1ae8e83777db972ffa65f9dc63566e4da11dc449a1c486f01a5d481f085c54e", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nごめんなさい、私、なんだかうまくできなくて……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n对不起，我不知道为什么没办法好好表现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ebb4b82707f7118c0f6d68b49b53b68b3a5fce525ae8b39a79db8e95c532f044", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来。\nどうした、何か悩んでるのか？", "zh": "辛苦你了，未来。\n怎么了，你有什么烦恼吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "1a4ff2336894c4dd11e2d33fbb308496d4c8d268579a6a7674456f2002630d14", "ja": "えっと……私、ライブが大好きなのに、\nさっきの撮影、なんだか楽しくできなくて……。", "zh": "就是……我明明最喜欢演唱会了，\n可是刚才拍摄的时候，却无法尽情表演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "faec3b9d4ce99defaf6aa38dc30a2faccb159edaf217e52bb18ec70406767a1e", "ja": "うう、なんでうまくいかないのかなぁ～……。\n{$P$}さん、わかりますか？", "zh": "呜呜，为什么就是表现不好呢……\n{$P$}先生，你知道原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "afa06fd7cde77939d363feb6d8bd968b0bfcd6930ee8cfaf1848e2b010d3951b", "ja": "そうだな。ライブとはいえファンの人達もいないし、\n本物のライブとは、雰囲気も違うけど……。", "zh": "这个嘛……虽说是演唱会，但是既没有粉丝在场，\n气氛也跟真正的演唱会不同……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "6eb148c4271f7b811a5372dedf356e99e996d0884f4b92a49516841970bba995", "ja": "そうなんです！\n{$P$}さん、それですよー！", "zh": "没错！\n{$P$}先生，就是这样没错──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "979f521f9183789a0890345bfcb97d515323057538b28edc50ffa8dd98412e2c", "ja": "いつも応援してくれるファンのみんながいないから、\n私、どうしたらいいかわかんなくなっちゃったのかも？", "zh": "就是因为少了平时为我加油打气的粉丝们，\n所以我表演起来才会不知所措吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e04f542e94988c185c90e18ba98fa1d864ba24b4f7bd460127937d59ebf9fb6f", "ja": "なるほど、そうか。\nそれでうまくいかなかったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事。\n所以才没法表现得很好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "d81d55f4e9ca61f416f427be7f696e820ed0954c2b2a216799879dab5a9899b8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、さすが～！\n頭いい！！　天才っ♪", "zh": "真不愧是{$P$}先生～！\n好聪明！！天才♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "214fe2eedf4e75c57ecb1885238885feddbc8af5d5ca90d45f91565b4a4785e4", "ja": "いや、それほどでも……じゃなくて。\n未来、お客さんがいなくても頑張らないと！", "zh": "哎呀，也没那么夸张啦……重点不是这个。\n未来，就算没有观众也得加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e091a99f801f9a12856d2c2d2ef59b2c87f20feefeae455e29faaaf53f92e2fb", "ja": "完成したPVを見るのは、未来のファンの人達なんだ。\nだったら、ちゃんといいものを届けないとな！", "zh": "会看到这支PV成品的人，就是你的粉丝啊。\n既然如此，就要呈现出优质的作品给他们看才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "140da3baab626866103550cd8e8fc07039f802d961b3dfbb87c57bfb4271bd7c", "ja": "あっ、そっか！　このPVって、\n私のファンの人たちが見てくれるんだ！", "zh": "啊，对耶！\n这支PV是要给我的粉丝看的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "d40bf026a56ca87b89b653cf26f287893cd9601a20a09b72e370e47b9b849880", "ja": "そういうことだ。カメラの向こうにいる\nファンのみんなを元気にするつもりで、頑張ろう！", "zh": "就是这样。你要把活力带给镜头另一端的粉丝，\n以这一点为目标，努力加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "53ea3444acc8a27ee757c4f58eca7b231f0d67ff04da340ae272cafb9ab81b78", "ja": "はい、わかりましたっ！\nよーしっ、いっくぞ～♪", "zh": "是，我知道了！\n好～我要上啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "2508c1581ec498495d92fbfb505bbe924b1b1e24d9e7d4836eebe5549af4da14", "ja": "春日未来、準備完了ですっ！\nよろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "春日未来，准备好了！\n拜托各位了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b993f67a3791e62be7dd282035c18ff7455ef3c679bdc7c6ee3441f122fc5bad", "ja": "（その後、未来は一発でOKをもぎとってみせた。\nスタッフも笑顔にしてしまう、最高のライブだった！）", "zh": "（在这之后，未来成功让导演一次就喊OK。\n那是场连工作人员也跟着展露笑容，最棒的演唱会！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "daf88ce80b64e2baf6f9f3689a31a87c1b4c497761df4f5f7473a57c16d1feb7", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6f0740981ae338fa88c23b0fc4ee6c26807e35da9fb5505faf1245d1553edf6e", "ja": "お疲れさま、未来！\nよくやったな！", "zh": "辛苦了，未来！\n你表现得很好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "c8df971dd05add1230852ecf586783ec12f7f9160ab96e340438a2103549b9d3", "ja": "でへへ～♪　だって、\nみんなを元気にしろって言われましたから！", "zh": "嘿嘿～♪\n因为你叫我要带给大家活力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "615b4f98cff225966dd2cc415764ca20a60a68b7ecbe7aefc8e1412615608781", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、\n私の元気、伝わりましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你也感受到我的活力了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9558746b5cdaf9cb6bcd0a6eb8076657d05080588b04452da4e398a8ed85f8ac", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。\n元気をもらったよ！", "zh": "嗯，当然。\n我也有从中获得活力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0064_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "28da05d0a37f71e4eb4081183081738092626249a6bc4423faca315c9802a40e", "ja": "よかった♪　これからも私、\nいっぱい、いーっぱい、元気を届けちゃいますね！", "zh": "那太好了♪\n今后我也会传递出很多很～多活力喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
